// Races (cosmetic only for now) and the choices on the creation screen.
//   faces: face + hair, each a head in client/models.ron `heads`
//   skins / hair: colours (red, green, blue; 0-1)
//   features: the race's own feature in several styles (a look in
//     client/models.ron `features`); feature_colors colour horns and
//     scales (ears and fur follow the skin or hair instead)
